=You are writing the body copy for a short notification email sent to students on a learning platform.

Type: {{ $json.kindLabel }}
Title: {{ $json.title }}
Course: {{ $json.courseTitle }}
Instructor: {{ $json.instructorName }}
Deadline: {{ $json.deadlineText }}
Total marks: {{ $json.totalMarks }}
Instructor's description: {{ $json.description }}

Write two or three short sentences telling the students what has been posted and what they should do next. Mention the deadline naturally if one is set. Keep it warm, plain and direct — no hype, no exclamation marks.

Return ONLY those sentences. No greeting, no sign-off, no subject line, no markdown, no bullet points, no placeholder names.

